  ],
  "duration_s": 402.866009,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "假如有来生，我还要搞导弹，这是一个九十五岁老人在病榻上留下的最后一句话。说完这句话，没多久他就走了。你可能没听过他的名字，但你今天能安安稳稳坐在家里吃饭、睡觉，刷手机，不用担惊受怕，跟这个人有天大的关系。他叫黄尾鹿，两弹一星元勋，中国第一枚潜地导弹巨浪一号总是计天历史，有人叫他巨浪之父，也有人叫他东风二十一之父。但这些头衔他活着的时候，几乎没人知道，故事得从一九四三年的伦敦说起。那一年，二十七岁的黄纬路在英国一家无线电工厂实习。那天早上，他像往常一样往工厂走，因为是实习生公司规定他可以比正式员工晚到半个小时，就这半个小时救了他一条命。等他走到工厂门口，整个人都傻了。昨天还好好的，车间被完全炸毁一枚德国导弹，就落在他办公室外面几米远的地方，五位朝夕相处的英国同事不幸全部遇难。那个他每天坐的位置已经荡然无存，他站在废墟前面，浑身发抖，不是害怕，是一种说不出来的痛。他想，如果我的祖国也有这样的武器，谁敢来欺负我们？如果中国没有导弹，老百姓的命就跟这五个同事一样，说没就没了。从那天起，这个年轻人心里埋下了一颗种子，中国必须有自己的导弹。后来，英国博物馆把一枚缴获的德国v突导弹解剖了，展出黄纬路挤在人群里围着这个十几米长的大家伙一圈一圈的看看了一遍又一遍。别人看个新鲜，他看的是怎么造出来的，他心里只有一个念头，这东西中国必须也得有。一九四七年，黄伟禄拿到了伦敦大学帝国学院的硕士学位。英国好几家公司抢着要他开的薪水高的吓人，他想都没想全拒了。收拾行李回了国有人说他傻，他才不傻，他心里装着那片废墟，装着那五位再也回不来的同事。回国之后，他等了整整九年。一九五六年春天，中南海怀仁堂内，黄纬路坐在台下听刚刚回国的钱学森讲火箭技术。钱学森说了一句话，他记了一辈子外国人能搞出来的东西，我们中国人也一定能搞出来。报告会结束，黄纬路热血沸腾。没过多久，他就被抽调到了刚刚成立的导弹研制机构，从此，这个人从公众视野里彻底消失了。尚不告父母，下不告妻儿，家里人只知道他在搞科研搞什么，不能说去哪儿了，不能说什么时候回来，更不能说当时的条件有多苦。说出来你可能不信。研究院在北京永定路用的是旧校舍，周围全是荒地，没有资料，没有图纸，没有样品，连一台像样的计算器都没有。整个团队就靠手摇计算器计算尺一笔一笔的算草稿纸堆了满满一屋子。聂荣臻元帅说了一句话，我们要搞蒸汽弹，为中国人民争气。黄伟路负责的是导弹控制系统，说白了就是导弹的大脑和神经，飞得稳不稳，打的准不准。全看这个。他带着团队没日没夜的干办公室，就是家楼里的灯经常亮到天亮。那几年正好赶上国家最困难的时候，饭都吃不饱。黄伟禄本来就有魏溃疡的老毛病，一饿就疼，一疼就是几个小时，他不去医院也不跟人说疼的实在扛不住了，就用手死死抵住胸口，接着算接着干。后来他女儿收拾衣服的时候，发现一件贴身背心，胸口位置磨出了一个大洞。女儿问他怎么回事，他轻描淡写的说了一句，疼的时候抵一抵磨的。你想想一件厚棉布背心得用多大的劲，抵多长时间才能磨出一个洞，那不是磨的那是拿命在扛啊。就是在这样的条件下，奇迹一个接一个的来了。一九六零年十一月，东风一号发射成功，中国有了自己的第一枚导弹。一九六四年六月，东风二号发射成功，中国人自己设计的导弹飞上了天。一九六六年十月，导弹带的特殊弹头精准命中目标，两弹结合，试验圆满成功。中国终于有了真正的战略威慑能力，从一无所有到两弹结合，他们只用了十年，外国人搞了几十年的路，中国人十年就走完了，可黄尾路还没来得及喘口气。一个更难更险、更要命的任务落到了他的肩上。那一年，他五十四岁这个任务就是把导弹藏到海里，从潜艇上发射一个五十四岁的老人能不能扛得住，他又会付出怎样的代价？讲到这儿，如果你也被黄纬禄老人的故事触动了麻烦点个赞，把这条视频收藏起来。再转发给身边的朋友，让更多人知道这位隐姓埋名一辈子的护国英雄。评论区留下一句黄老，辛苦了。关注我，下集更精彩。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1190,
      "text": "假如有来生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1410,
      "end_ms": 2490,
      "text": "我还要搞导弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2850,
      "end_ms": 7350,
      "text": "这是一个九十五岁老人在病榻上留下的最后一句话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7810,
      "end_ms": 8610,
      "text": "说完这句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8610,
      "end_ms": 10090,
      "text": "没多久他就走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10430,
      "end_ms": 12190,
      "text": "你可能没听过他的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12610,
      "end_ms": 16190,
      "text": "但你今天能安安稳稳坐在家里吃饭、睡觉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16370,
      "end_ms": 17090,
      "text": "刷手机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17570,
      "end_ms": 18830,
      "text": "不用担惊受怕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00010",
      "start_ms": 19590,
      "end_ms": 21450,
      "text": "跟这个人有天大的关系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00011",
      "start_ms": 22270,
      "end_ms": 23370,
      "text": "他叫黄尾鹿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00012",
      "start_ms": 23430,
      "end_ms": 25230,
      "text": "两弹一星元勋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25750,
      "end_ms": 30420,
      "text": "中国第一枚潜地导弹巨浪一号总是计天历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30940,
      "end_ms": 33040,
      "text": "有人叫他巨浪之父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33120,
      "end_ms": 35260,
      "text": "也有人叫他东风二十一之父。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00016",
      "start_ms": 35920,
      "end_ms": 38540,
      "text": "但这些头衔他活着的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38880,
      "end_ms": 40040,
      "text": "几乎没人知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00018",
      "start_ms": 40820,
      "end_ms": 43700,
      "text": "故事得从一九四三年的伦敦说起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00019",
      "start_ms": 44240,
      "end_ms": 44840,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00020",
      "start_ms": 45100,
      "end_ms": 49380,
      "text": "二十七岁的黄纬路在英国一家无线电工厂实习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00021",
      "start_ms": 49980,
      "end_ms": 50760,
      "text": "那天早上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00022",
      "start_ms": 50940,
      "end_ms": 53440,
      "text": "他像往常一样往工厂走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00023",
      "start_ms": 53680,
      "end_ms": 59795,
      "text": "因为是实习生公司规定他可以比正式员工晚到半个小时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60400,
      "end_ms": 62735,
      "text": "就这半个小时救了他一条命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00025",
      "start_ms": 63310,
      "end_ms": 64790,
      "text": "等他走到工厂门口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00026",
      "start_ms": 65090,
      "end_ms": 66385,
      "text": "整个人都傻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00027",
      "start_ms": 66590,
      "end_ms": 68010,
      "text": "昨天还好好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00028",
      "start_ms": 68010,
      "end_ms": 71620,
      "text": "车间被完全炸毁一枚德国导弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00029",
      "start_ms": 71680,
      "end_ms": 74525,
      "text": "就落在他办公室外面几米远的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00030",
      "start_ms": 74790,
      "end_ms": 79185,
      "text": "五位朝夕相处的英国同事不幸全部遇难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00031",
      "start_ms": 79710,
      "end_ms": 82885,
      "text": "那个他每天坐的位置已经荡然无存，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00032",
      "start_ms": 83510,
      "end_ms": 85155,
      "text": "他站在废墟前面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00033",
      "start_ms": 85470,
      "end_ms": 86355,
      "text": "浑身发抖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00034",
      "start_ms": 86670,
      "end_ms": 87525,
      "text": "不是害怕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00035",
      "start_ms": 87820,
      "end_ms": 89375,
      "text": "是一种说不出来的痛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00036",
      "start_ms": 90190,
      "end_ms": 90665,
      "text": "他想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00037",
      "start_ms": 91140,
      "end_ms": 93805,
      "text": "如果我的祖国也有这样的武器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00038",
      "start_ms": 94300,
      "end_ms": 95605,
      "text": "谁敢来欺负我们？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00039",
      "start_ms": 96080,
      "end_ms": 97595,
      "text": "如果中国没有导弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00040",
      "start_ms": 97850,
      "end_ms": 100630,
      "text": "老百姓的命就跟这五个同事一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00041",
      "start_ms": 100650,
      "end_ms": 101685,
      "text": "说没就没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00042",
      "start_ms": 102040,
      "end_ms": 103005,
      "text": "从那天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00043",
      "start_ms": 103400,
      "end_ms": 106165,
      "text": "这个年轻人心里埋下了一颗种子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00044",
      "start_ms": 106810,
      "end_ms": 109015,
      "text": "中国必须有自己的导弹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00045",
      "start_ms": 109870,
      "end_ms": 110310,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00046",
      "start_ms": 110590,
      "end_ms": 115250,
      "text": "英国博物馆把一枚缴获的德国v突导弹解剖了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00047",
      "start_ms": 115250,
      "end_ms": 125015,
      "text": "展出黄纬路挤在人群里围着这个十几米长的大家伙一圈一圈的看看了一遍又一遍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00048",
      "start_ms": 125480,
      "end_ms": 126715,
      "text": "别人看个新鲜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00049",
      "start_ms": 127050,
      "end_ms": 128750,
      "text": "他看的是怎么造出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00050",
      "start_ms": 128990,
      "end_ms": 130505,
      "text": "他心里只有一个念头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00051",
      "start_ms": 131330,
      "end_ms": 135015,
      "text": "这东西中国必须也得有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00052",
      "start_ms": 136770,
      "end_ms": 137830,
      "text": "一九四七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00053",
      "start_ms": 137910,
      "end_ms": 141725,
      "text": "黄伟禄拿到了伦敦大学帝国学院的硕士学位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00054",
      "start_ms": 142130,
      "end_ms": 146705,
      "text": "英国好几家公司抢着要他开的薪水高的吓人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00055",
      "start_ms": 147450,
      "end_ms": 149710,
      "text": "他想都没想全拒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00056",
      "start_ms": 149850,
      "end_ms": 152515,
      "text": "收拾行李回了国有人说他傻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00057",
      "start_ms": 152760,
      "end_ms": 153445,
      "text": "他才不傻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00058",
      "start_ms": 154110,
      "end_ms": 155625,
      "text": "他心里装着那片废墟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00059",
      "start_ms": 155950,
      "end_ms": 158035,
      "text": "装着那五位再也回不来的同事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00060",
      "start_ms": 158590,
      "end_ms": 159330,
      "text": "回国之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00061",
      "start_ms": 159530,
      "end_ms": 161295,
      "text": "他等了整整九年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00062",
      "start_ms": 163110,
      "end_ms": 164495,
      "text": "一九五六年春天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00063",
      "start_ms": 165030,
      "end_ms": 166695,
      "text": "中南海怀仁堂内，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00064",
      "start_ms": 167050,
      "end_ms": 173235,
      "text": "黄纬路坐在台下听刚刚回国的钱学森讲火箭技术。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00065",
      "start_ms": 174010,
      "end_ms": 175430,
      "text": "钱学森说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00066",
      "start_ms": 175450,
      "end_ms": 178965,
      "text": "他记了一辈子外国人能搞出来的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00067",
      "start_ms": 179420,
      "end_ms": 181285,
      "text": "我们中国人也一定能搞出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00068",
      "start_ms": 182380,
      "end_ms": 183475,
      "text": "报告会结束，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00069",
      "start_ms": 184230,
      "end_ms": 186145,
      "text": "黄纬路热血沸腾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00070",
      "start_ms": 186540,
      "end_ms": 187385,
      "text": "没过多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00071",
      "start_ms": 187760,
      "end_ms": 191325,
      "text": "他就被抽调到了刚刚成立的导弹研制机构，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00072",
      "start_ms": 191780,
      "end_ms": 192355,
      "text": "从此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00073",
      "start_ms": 192790,
      "end_ms": 196645,
      "text": "这个人从公众视野里彻底消失了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00074",
      "start_ms": 197530,
      "end_ms": 198565,
      "text": "尚不告父母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00075",
      "start_ms": 198930,
      "end_ms": 199795,
      "text": "下不告妻儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00076",
      "start_ms": 200640,
      "end_ms": 204145,
      "text": "家里人只知道他在搞科研搞什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00077",
      "start_ms": 205120,
      "end_ms": 207665,
      "text": "不能说去哪儿了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00078",
      "start_ms": 208130,
      "end_ms": 209945,
      "text": "不能说什么时候回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00079",
      "start_ms": 210750,
      "end_ms": 213210,
      "text": "更不能说当时的条件有多苦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00080",
      "start_ms": 213490,
      "end_ms": 214925,
      "text": "说出来你可能不信。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00081",
      "start_ms": 215240,
      "end_ms": 218725,
      "text": "研究院在北京永定路用的是旧校舍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00082",
      "start_ms": 219030,
      "end_ms": 220415,
      "text": "周围全是荒地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00083",
      "start_ms": 220770,
      "end_ms": 221510,
      "text": "没有资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00084",
      "start_ms": 221770,
      "end_ms": 222725,
      "text": "没有图纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00085",
      "start_ms": 223060,
      "end_ms": 223915,
      "text": "没有样品，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00086",
      "start_ms": 224250,
      "end_ms": 226485,
      "text": "连一台像样的计算器都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00087",
      "start_ms": 226970,
      "end_ms": 236055,
      "text": "整个团队就靠手摇计算器计算尺一笔一笔的算草稿纸堆了满满一屋子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00088",
      "start_ms": 236470,
      "end_ms": 238165,
      "text": "聂荣臻元帅说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00089",
      "start_ms": 239720,
      "end_ms": 241075,
      "text": "我们要搞蒸汽弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00090",
      "start_ms": 241490,
      "end_ms": 243215,
      "text": "为中国人民争气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00091",
      "start_ms": 244120,
      "end_ms": 247450,
      "text": "黄伟路负责的是导弹控制系统，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00092",
      "start_ms": 247790,
      "end_ms": 250930,
      "text": "说白了就是导弹的大脑和神经，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00093",
      "start_ms": 251090,
      "end_ms": 252030,
      "text": "飞得稳不稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00094",
      "start_ms": 252190,
      "end_ms": 253115,
      "text": "打的准不准。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00095",
      "start_ms": 253400,
      "end_ms": 254245,
      "text": "全看这个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00096",
      "start_ms": 254800,
      "end_ms": 257700,
      "text": "他带着团队没日没夜的干办公室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00097",
      "start_ms": 257700,
      "end_ms": 261655,
      "text": "就是家楼里的灯经常亮到天亮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00098",
      "start_ms": 262340,
      "end_ms": 266205,
      "text": "那几年正好赶上国家最困难的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00099",
      "start_ms": 266570,
      "end_ms": 267475,
      "text": "饭都吃不饱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00100",
      "start_ms": 268490,
      "end_ms": 270945,
      "text": "黄伟禄本来就有魏溃疡的老毛病，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00101",
      "start_ms": 271290,
      "end_ms": 272435,
      "text": "一饿就疼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00102",
      "start_ms": 272800,
      "end_ms": 274425,
      "text": "一疼就是几个小时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00103",
      "start_ms": 275240,
      "end_ms": 278995,
      "text": "他不去医院也不跟人说疼的实在扛不住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00104",
      "start_ms": 279340,
      "end_ms": 281420,
      "text": "就用手死死抵住胸口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00105",
      "start_ms": 281700,
      "end_ms": 283290,
      "text": "接着算接着干。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00106",
      "start_ms": 283390,
      "end_ms": 285290,
      "text": "后来他女儿收拾衣服的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00107",
      "start_ms": 285450,
      "end_ms": 287305,
      "text": "发现一件贴身背心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00108",
      "start_ms": 287710,
      "end_ms": 290455,
      "text": "胸口位置磨出了一个大洞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00109",
      "start_ms": 290860,
      "end_ms": 292155,
      "text": "女儿问他怎么回事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00110",
      "start_ms": 292810,
      "end_ms": 294685,
      "text": "他轻描淡写的说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00111",
      "start_ms": 295040,
      "end_ms": 297545,
      "text": "疼的时候抵一抵磨的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00112",
      "start_ms": 298200,
      "end_ms": 302710,
      "text": "你想想一件厚棉布背心得用多大的劲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00113",
      "start_ms": 302890,
      "end_ms": 305715,
      "text": "抵多长时间才能磨出一个洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00114",
      "start_ms": 306130,
      "end_ms": 308625,
      "text": "那不是磨的那是拿命在扛啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00115",
      "start_ms": 309090,
      "end_ms": 310790,
      "text": "就是在这样的条件下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00116",
      "start_ms": 311390,
      "end_ms": 313730,
      "text": "奇迹一个接一个的来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00117",
      "start_ms": 314690,
      "end_ms": 316410,
      "text": "一九六零年十一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00118",
      "start_ms": 316630,
      "end_ms": 318750,
      "text": "东风一号发射成功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00119",
      "start_ms": 318830,
      "end_ms": 321010,
      "text": "中国有了自己的第一枚导弹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00120",
      "start_ms": 321370,
      "end_ms": 322810,
      "text": "一九六四年六月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00121",
      "start_ms": 323030,
      "end_ms": 324530,
      "text": "东风二号发射成功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00122",
      "start_ms": 325010,
      "end_ms": 328035,
      "text": "中国人自己设计的导弹飞上了天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00123",
      "start_ms": 330470,
      "end_ms": 331910,
      "text": "一九六六年十月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00124",
      "start_ms": 332370,
      "end_ms": 335330,
      "text": "导弹带的特殊弹头精准命中目标，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00125",
      "start_ms": 335750,
      "end_ms": 336790,
      "text": "两弹结合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00126",
      "start_ms": 336790,
      "end_ms": 338250,
      "text": "试验圆满成功。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00127",
      "start_ms": 339230,
      "end_ms": 344490,
      "text": "中国终于有了真正的战略威慑能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00128",
      "start_ms": 345650,
      "end_ms": 348430,
      "text": "从一无所有到两弹结合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00129",
      "start_ms": 349030,
      "end_ms": 350530,
      "text": "他们只用了十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00130",
      "start_ms": 351530,
      "end_ms": 353470,
      "text": "外国人搞了几十年的路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00131",
      "start_ms": 354250,
      "end_ms": 356450,
      "text": "中国人十年就走完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00132",
      "start_ms": 357310,
      "end_ms": 359810,
      "text": "可黄尾路还没来得及喘口气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00133",
      "start_ms": 359890,
      "end_ms": 364520,
      "text": "一个更难更险、更要命的任务落到了他的肩上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00134",
      "start_ms": 365280,
      "end_ms": 365900,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00135",
      "start_ms": 366320,
      "end_ms": 372485,
      "text": "他五十四岁这个任务就是把导弹藏到海里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00136",
      "start_ms": 373860,
      "end_ms": 379425,
      "text": "从潜艇上发射一个五十四岁的老人能不能扛得住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00137",
      "start_ms": 379780,
      "end_ms": 381765,
      "text": "他又会付出怎样的代价？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00138",
      "start_ms": 382550,
      "end_ms": 383285,
      "text": "讲到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00139",
      "start_ms": 383680,
      "end_ms": 387685,
      "text": "如果你也被黄纬禄老人的故事触动了麻烦点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00140",
      "start_ms": 388190,
      "end_ms": 389885,
      "text": "把这条视频收藏起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00141",
      "start_ms": 390270,
      "end_ms": 392615,
      "text": "再转发给身边的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00142",
      "start_ms": 393060,
      "end_ms": 397360,
      "text": "让更多人知道这位隐姓埋名一辈子的护国英雄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00143",
      "start_ms": 397520,
      "end_ms": 399315,
      "text": "评论区留下一句黄老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00144",
      "start_ms": 399620,
      "end_ms": 400225,
      "text": "辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00145",
      "start_ms": 400560,
      "end_ms": 401125,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_afd4090179833071_s00146",
      "start_ms": 401460,
      "end_ms": 402735,
      "text": "下集更精彩。"
    }
  ],
